body:
I think extension like `.txt` is not supported by `FileDialog` filters and it needs to be like `*.txt`.
But for being on safe side, we can just have one check and remove everything before `.`
```kotlin
if (p_input.contains(".")) {
    input = p_input.substring(p_input.indexOf(".") + 1);
}
```

